+//   GGML_CUDA_FA_GEMM_CONV_BLOCK=128|256|512, GGML_CUDA_FA_GEMM_CONV_GRID (default 256 / 65535)
+//   GGML_CUDA_FA_SPLIT=<file>: per-phase time (pack, convert, QK sgemm, softmax, PV sgemm, reduce, op total) written at exit
